    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but let go of what? it's not just about control. it's the actual pain of just existing through it. like, if i let go, i'm still just gonna wake up tomorrow and do the exact same thing, go through the same shame. it just feels so pointless. what's even the point of the struggle if the result is always the same?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
